{"nodes": [{"id": "template_starter_readme_module_starter_playbook", "label": "MODULE-STARTER Playbook", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "template_starter/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Start-here playbook for creating a new Simatrix simulation. Exists because Simatrix has no build step, no shared library, and no sync tooling, so hand-made copies will drift unless the right files are copied and only the right ones adapted."}, {"id": "template_starter_readme_case_a", "label": "Case A - New Module 2 Topic", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "template_starter/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A new 3D-solids topic in the Engineering Graphics family: copy the whole Module2 master and simplify down, scoping content with the single ENABLED_TIERS flag."}, {"id": "template_starter_readme_case_b", "label": "Case B - New Module 1 Topic", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "template_starter/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A new drawing-foundations lesson: not a whole-folder copy but a new thin HTML page + small orchestrator + pure data files served by the one shared engine.js, which is never edited to add a lesson."}, {"id": "template_starter_readme_case_c", "label": "Case C - New Subject Module", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "template_starter/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A whole new discipline that does NOT clone Module2/Module1 or share the root ARCHITECTURE/DECISIONS/RULES. It builds a fresh platform skeleton from CLAUDE.module-template.md + PLATFORM-RULES.md and writes its own three docs before development."}, {"id": "template_starter_readme_module2_master", "label": "Module2 Master (single source of truth)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "template_starter/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Module2/ is the master and single source of truth; topic folders are its copies (their names don't reveal it). A fix to a shared file belongs in Module2 and must be re-copied, never edited in place, or copies drift (ADR-009)."}, {"id": "template_starter_readme_module1_shared_engine", "label": "Module 1 Shared-Engine Pattern", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "template_starter/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One shared engine.js serves seven thin lesson pages; CSS lives in shell.css, not inline. A new lesson supplies data, never an engine edit (ADR-011)."}, {"id": "template_starter_readme_enabled_tiers", "label": "ENABLED_TIERS Scope Flag", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "template_starter/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The single switch in src/problems.js that scopes a topic clone to the tiers it can actually solve (ADR-009); flip it before touching UI so the library and stepper agree on scope."}, {"id": "template_starter_readme_byte_identical_files", "label": "Byte-Identical Shared Contract Files", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "template_starter/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "anim.js, cube/cone/cylinder generators, genericPrism/Pyramid/Solid, meshAnalyzer, vertexLabeler, and the three woff2 fonts are md5-verified identical across the family. Editing a copy in place silently forks the platform; a fix goes in Module2 and is re-copied."}, {"id": "template_starter_readme_ishape_trap", "label": "iShape.js Copy-Identical Trap", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "template_starter/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "iShape.js looks like a shared contract but Module2's version (larger, imports THREE, carries VP lay-down + inclination) is NOT identical to the topics' smaller version and was never back-copied. Treat it as adapt, not copy-identical (ADR-027)."}, {"id": "template_starter_readme_zxy_euler_order", "label": "ZXY Euler Order", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "template_starter/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "applyShapeTransform must keep the explicit ZXY Euler order and every ported sign must be re-derived visually (ADR-005), or geometry comes out plausible-but-wrong (mirrored)."}, {"id": "template_starter_readme_headless_verification", "label": "Headless Verification (DevTools Protocol)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "template_starter/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Verify the shipped module by driving Chrome over the DevTools Protocol with Node's built-in WebSocket/fetch, cache disabled, never puppeteer/playwright, verifying the real file (ADR-019). Confirm renderer.info.memory stays flat across 50 rapid regenerations."}, {"id": "template_starter_readme_title_meta_consistency", "label": "index.html <title> to meta.json.title Consistency", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "template_starter/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The <title> must match meta.json.title (browser-tab text + screen-reader name, ADR-026). A shipped Topic 2 inconsistency (title stayed 'Orthographic Projection of Solids' vs meta 'Simple Positions') is the flagged mistake not to repeat."}, {"id": "template_starter_readme_orient_intuition_arc", "label": "Orient to Intuition to Problem-solving Arc", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "template_starter/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every sim must move the learner through Orient -> Intuition -> Problem-solving (PRODUCT.md pedagogy); the first-session build order mirrors this arc."}], "edges": [{"source": "template_starter_readme_orient_intuition_arc", "target": "template_starter_claude_product_md", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "template_starter/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "template_starter_readme_module_starter_playbook", "target": "template_starter_readme_case_a", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "template_starter/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "template_starter_readme_module_starter_playbook", "target": "template_starter_readme_case_b", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "template_starter/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "template_starter_readme_module_starter_playbook", "target": "template_starter_readme_case_c", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "template_starter/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "template_starter_readme_case_a", "target": "template_starter_readme_module2_master", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "template_starter/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "template_starter_readme_case_b", "target": "template_starter_readme_module1_shared_engine", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "template_starter/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "template_starter_readme_case_c", "target": "template_starter_claude_platform_rules", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "template_starter/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "template_starter_readme_case_c", "target": "template_starter_claude_module_local_docs", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "template_starter/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "template_starter_readme_case_c", "target": "template_starter_claude_starter_template", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "template_starter/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "template_starter_readme_case_c", "target": "template_starter_readme_module2_master", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "template_starter/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "template_starter_readme_case_a", "target": "template_starter_readme_enabled_tiers", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "template_starter/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "template_starter_readme_case_a", "target": "template_starter_readme_byte_identical_files", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "template_starter/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "template_starter_readme_case_a", "target": "template_starter_readme_ishape_trap", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "template_starter/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "template_starter_readme_byte_identical_files", "target": "template_starter_readme_module2_master", 